CR PlayCard Agent — live observation, inference and Android touch bridge.

This release includes original bridge software and adaptations of FirstLight CR
under Apache-2.0. The original FirstLight project and its model weights have not
been changed by this release. See LICENSE, probe/FIRSTLIGHT_NOTICE.md and
probe/UPSTREAM_NOTICE for upstream attribution and material boundaries.

Release packaging modifies local configuration, launchers and probe installation;
the default native probe is the previously validated stable build. Experimental
source is retained for reproducibility but is not the default runtime profile.

No APK, original game/SDK library, training replay, model weight or game resource
is redistributed here. The original SDK required by the proxy is preserved from
the user's own installation on that user's device. Product names identify
compatibility; this project is not affiliated with Supercell, Null's or MuMu.
